    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>271484</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VSM_320_020_002&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>…………</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>2</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>271548</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VSM_320_020_003&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>静かだね……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>It's so quiet...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>3</SpeakerId>
      <Id>3</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>271644</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VSM_320_020_004&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>静かすぎて、
耳の中がつん
ってするぐらい……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>It's so quiet I feel almost deaf...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>4</SpeakerId>
      <Id>4</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>271728</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VSM_320_020_005&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>感じるよ……
もうひとりの自分を</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>I can feel them...the other me is here...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>5</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>271820</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VSM_320_020_006&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>うん……オレも。
あいつら、ここにいる</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Yeah, I can feel that guy too.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>6</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>271920</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VSM_320_020_007&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>……決着をつけるって
あのふたりを倒すってこと？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>When you said you wanted to set things right...
you meant that you're going to defeat them?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>4</SpeakerId>
      <Id>7</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>272020</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VSM_320_020_008&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>そーゆーこと。
悪いことしたヤツは、
倒さねーとな</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Yep! They are bad guys, so
we have to beat em up!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>8</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>272140</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VSM_320_020_009&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>自分の悪い心に勝つ、
それがノルンがわたしたちに
与えた試練だからね</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>We need to prevail against their malice.
That's why Norn gave us this trial in
the first place, wasn't it?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>9</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>272208</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VSM_320_020_010&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>そう、なんだ……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Right, yeah...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>4</SpeakerId>
      <Id>10</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>272272</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VSM_320_020_011&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>行こーぜ！</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>...Let's go!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>11</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>272332</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VSM_320_020_012&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>……うん</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>...Yes.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>12</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>272520</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VSM_320_020_013&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>……&lt;Cless&gt;さんや&lt;Mint&gt;さん……
それにダオスさえも……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>...Mister &lt;Cless&gt; and Miss
&lt;Mint&gt;...even Dhaos...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>4</SpeakerId>
      <Id>13</Id>
      <BubbleId>0</BubbleId>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>272520</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VSM_320_020_014&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>今まで会ってきた人たちが
きみたちの決断を
支えてくれたんだね……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Everyone they've met is supporting
them in this decision...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>4</SpeakerId>
      <Id>13</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
